            "value": "The Science Library Newsletter is the newsletter of the Robin Li & Melissa Ma Science Library, Stanford University.  The inaugural issue was published on October 12, 2017.  The newsletter is published approximately monthly from September through June for approximately ten issues per year.  No issues were published in March 2020 or April 2020. ",
